@{
	ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}

<div class="page-hero mb-4">
	<h1 class="mb-1">Privacy</h1>
	<p class="text-muted mb-0">Short version: no tracking, no ads, no analytics. Offer details are used only to reply to you.</p>
</div>

<div class="card card-body shadow-sm">
	<h2 class="h5">Who runs this site</h2>
	<p>
		This is a personal, non-commercial website that shows my LEGO minifigure collection.
	</p>

	<h2 class="h5 mt-3">Visitors</h2>
	<p>
		You can browse the collection without an account. The site uses no analytics, no advertising
		and no tracking, and it loads nothing from other websites: fonts, scripts and images all come from this site.
	</p>

	<h2 class="h5 mt-3">Buy and trade offers</h2>
	<p class="mb-2">If you send an offer for a figure, the following is stored:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>your <strong>name</strong> and <strong>e-mail address</strong>, so I can reply to you;</li>
		<li>your <strong>offer</strong>: the price you offer, or what you offer in exchange, and your optional message;</li>
		<li>which <strong>figure</strong> the offer is for, its asking price at that moment, and <strong>when</strong> you sent it.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		This information is used <strong>only to reply to your offer</strong>. It is never shared, sold or used for newsletters,
		and only I can see it. Offers are deleted at the latest <strong>6 months</strong> after they have been handled.
		Your IP address is not stored with your offer; it is only used briefly to limit how many offers can be sent in a short time.
	</p>

	<h2 class="h5 mt-3">Cookies</h2>
	<p class="mb-2">Only cookies the site needs to work are used:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Login cookie</strong>: only set when the site owner logs in to manage the collection.</li>
		<li><strong>Security cookie</strong>: protects forms (such as the offer and login forms) against forged submissions.</li>
		<li><strong>Message cookie</strong>: briefly stores a status message (for example "Saved") after an admin action.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>Because these cookies are strictly necessary, no cookie consent banner is shown.</p>

	<h2 class="h5 mt-3">Stored in your browser</h2>
	<p>
		Your choice of light, dark or automatic theme is saved in your browser's local storage.
		It never leaves your device.
	</p>

	<h2 class="h5 mt-3">Server logs</h2>
	<p>
		Like most websites, the server keeps technical logs (such as IP address, time and requested page)
		to keep the site secure and to fix errors. Failed login attempts are logged together with
		the entered e-mail and IP address, to protect the admin account. Offers are logged without
		your name or e-mail. Logs are kept only as long as needed for these purposes.
	</p>

	<h2 class="h5 mt-3">Your rights</h2>
	<p class="mb-0">
		You can ask what data about you is stored (including any offers you sent), ask for it to be corrected,
		or ask for it to be deleted, by contacting the site owner.
	</p>
</div>